      "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14230523/assets/be6a289223fdd6c6896278b5e179bf9f4a98d7f9e5988d1b5ae98a1217dd48b0.png)\n\nThe graph of $y=f(x)$ is shown above. Given that $y=f(x)$ is periodic with period $3,$ what is the value of $f(30)?$",
